T}	Thread safety	MT\-Safe
.TE
.SH 標準規格
C11, POSIX.1\-2008.
.SH 歴史
C99, POSIX.1\-2001.
.P
\fIdouble\fP 版の関数は SVr4, 4.3BSD にも準拠している。
.SH バグ
.\" Bug: https://www.sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=6759
.\" This can be seen in sysdeps/ieee754/k_standard.c
In glibc 2.9 and earlier, when a pole error occurs, \fIerrno\fP is set to
\fBEDOM\fP instead of the POSIX\-mandated \fBERANGE\fP.  Since glibc 2.10, glibc
does the right thing.
